graph LR
    CLI["odh-cli<br/>rhai-cli / kubectl-odh"]

    %% External Go dependencies
    CLI -->|K8s clients, SPDY exec| ClientGo["client-go / api / apimachinery<br/>v0.35.x"]
    CLI -->|kubectl config flags| CliRuntime["k8s.io/cli-runtime v0.35.2"]
    CLI -->|client utilities| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    CLI -->|CLI framework| Cobra["cobra v1.10.2 / pflag"]
    CLI -->|OLM types| OLMLib["operator-framework api v0.39.0<br/>OLM v0.40.0"]
    CLI -->|MCP server| MCPGo["mcp-go v0.55.1"]
    CLI -->|jq filtering| Gojq["gojq v0.12.18"]
    CLI -->|version compare| Semver["blang/semver v4"]
    CLI -->|schema generation| JSONSchema["invopop/jsonschema v0.14.0"]
    CLI -->|output| Table["tablewriter / fatih/color"]
    CLI -.->|tests only| Kind["sigs.k8s.io/kind v0.31.0"]

    %% Internal Go library dependencies
    CLI -->|clusterhealth, failureclassifier, mcptools| ODHOpLib["opendatahub-operator<br/>(Go library)"]
    CLI -->|platform detection, OLM helpers| PlatUtils["odh-platform-utilities v0.4.0"]
    CLI -->|embedded / fetched manifest| GitOps["odh-gitops"]

    %% Runtime API dependencies
    CLI ==>|HTTPS/6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes / OpenShift<br/>API Server"]
    K8sAPI --- DSC["DSC / DSCI<br/>(opendatahub-operator)"]
    K8sAPI --- OLM["OLM v0 / v1<br/>Subscription, CSV, ClusterExtension"]
    K8sAPI --- KServe["KServe<br/>InferenceService, ServingRuntime"]
    K8sAPI --- Kueue["Kueue / RHBOK"]
    K8sAPI --- TrustyCR["TrustyAI CRs"]
    K8sAPI --- DSP["Data Science Pipelines (DSPA)"]
    K8sAPI --- NB["Workbenches / Notebooks"]
    K8sAPI --- Ray["Ray / CodeFlare,<br/>Training Operator / Trainer"]
    K8sAPI --- Other["LlamaStack / OGX, Dashboard,<br/>Kuadrant / Authorino, Gateway API,<br/>Feast, Model Registry"]
    CLI -->|"HTTPS/443 (insecure verify)"| TrustyRoute["TrustyAI Service Route"]

    %% Integration points
    Agents["MCP Clients (AI agents)"] -->|MCP stdio / SSE loopback| CLI
    Admin["Cluster Administrator"] -->|invokes| CLI

